# Agent entrypoint

Read this map before acting. Follow the nearest nested agent instructions for any path you touch.

## Context map

- Product intent: `<product-record>`
- Architecture and public boundaries: `<architecture-record>`
- Quality invariants: `<quality-record>`
- Current repository snapshot: `<baseline-record>`
- Active work: `<active-task-location>`
- Decisions: `<decision-record-or-ADR-location>`

## Commands

- Start: `<start-command>`
- Unified check: `<check-command>`
- User-level smoke test: `<smoke-command>`

## Repository rules

- Use repository artifacts as state; chat history is not authoritative.
- Preserve pre-existing changes and stage explicit task-owned paths.
- Change protected tests, public contracts, or architecture rules only through a recorded contract
  revision.
- Finish with green gates, recorded runtime evidence, and a recoverable checkpoint.
